{"id":1307247,"imdb":"tt43669175","en":"OK! Madam: Bon Voyage","orig":"오케이 마담 2","ar":null,"tag":"All aboard! OK?","ov":"Six years after the Hawaii airplane hijacking, Mi-yeong finds herself struggling with her rebellious teenage daughter, Nari, and her unemployed husband, Seok-hwan. When Hyun-min, a flight attendant she met during the hijacking, invites her family to his wedding aboard a luxury cruise ship, Mi-yeong eagerly proposes a family holiday. Met with indifference from her husband and daughter, she decides to embark alone, joining Hyun-min's family and Ji-hoon, a charming magician. However, on the eve of the wedding, the celebration turns deadly when armed assailants seize the ship. After Seok-hwan and Nari are kidnapped and brought aboard, Mi-yeong discovers that she is the target of a much larger plot.","rd":"2026-08-12","rt":109,"g":[28,35],"lang":"ko","budget":0,"revenue":0,"companies":[{"n":"OAL","logo":null,"c":"KR"}],"countries":["KR"],"langs":["Korean"],"col":"OK! Madam Collection","rel":[{"c":"ID","d":"2026-08-12"},{"c":"KR","d":"2026-08-12"},{"c":"TW","d":"2026-08-12"},{"c":"SG","d":"2026-08-20"},{"c":"US","d":"2026-08-21"},{"c":"TH","d":"2026-08-27"},{"c":"MY","d":"2026-09-16"},{"c":"TR","d":"2026-09-18"}],"dir":["Lee Cheol-ha"],"prod":[],"wri":["Cha Su-hyeon"],"mus":["Dalpalan"],"dop":["Park Jong-cheol","Eom Si-woo"],"cast":[{"n":"Uhm Jung-hwa","ch":"Lee Mi-yeong","p":"/m2FWdLDVttcMrKcAjMKQx6Zhtfj.jpg"},{"n":"Park Sung-woong","ch":"Oh Seok-hwan","p":"/m6k3SCs4ppc73PaYQuGsVctmGTg.jpg"},{"n":"Lee Sang-yun","ch":"Lee Cheol-seung","p":"/kxLb9xvL94Q4Z6ELYU8OLjVzZCZ.jpg"},{"n":"Bae Jung-nam","ch":"Jung Hyun-min","p":"/m4DnODpzR5850HZZTnNQyPwyhQQ.jpg"},{"n":"Ryeoun","ch":"Im Ji-hoon","p":"/loev88wySqUjZHPL5Oq1AcOzBxN.jpg"},{"n":"Park Jin-joo","ch":"Bae Sun-ah","p":"/2loUUZGfslGkGComTUMp6ON2Kuc.jpg"},{"n":"Sooyoung Choi","ch":"Anya","p":"/ttti8CMjJzevHQFkIubJDDy7YDK.jpg"},{"n":"Jeong Su-been","ch":"Oh Nari","p":null},{"n":"Kim Eung-soo","ch":"","p":"/rQ